        "date": "2026-10-21T08:18:28Z"
      },
      "message": "test(m3): assert api_fetch body.values is 2-D array and body.flag is bool\n\nAdd two TestToolCallSchema cases (14_10 / 14_11) that verify a tool call\nwhose free-form `body` object carries fields with semantically significant\nJSON types:\n- body.values must stay a 2-D array (list of lists); some providers\n  flatten it or wrap rows as {\"item\": {\"item\": [...]}} objects.\n- body.flag must stay a JSON boolean; some providers stringify it to \"true\".\n\nBoth cases are parametrized over non_stream/stream.",
